#: ../../upstream/CHANGELOG.rst:4635
msgid ""
"We have removed our deprecated doc serving code that used ``core/views``, "
"``core/symlinks``, and ``builds/syncers`` (`#6535 "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/pull/6535>`__). All doc "
"serving should now be done via ``proxito``. In production this has been the "
"case for over a month, we have now removed the deprecated code from the "
"codebase."
msgstr ""
"We have 已移除 我们的 deprecated 文档 serving 代码 that used ``core/views``, "
"``core/symlinks``, 和 ``builds/syncers`` (`#6535 "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/pull/6535>`__). 所有 文档 "
"serving should now be done 通过 ``proxito``. 在 production 此 有 been 该 case 对 超过"
" 一个 month, we have now 已移除 该 deprecated 代码 从 该 codebase."

#: ../../upstream/CHANGELOG.rst:4636
msgid ""
"We did a large documentation refactor that should make things nicer to read "
"and highlights more of our existing features. This is the first of a series "
"of new documentation additions we have planned"
msgstr ""
