#: ../../upstream/CHANGELOG.rst:4671
msgid ""
"This release adds a few new features and bugfixes. The largest change is the"
" addition of ``hidden`` versions, which allows docs to be built but not "
"shown to users on the site. This will keep old links from breaking but not "
"direct new users there."
msgstr "此版本添加了一些新功能和缺陷修复。最大的变化是添加了 ``hidden`` 版本，允许文档被构建而不显示。"

#: ../../upstream/CHANGELOG.rst:4676
msgid ""
"We've also expanded the CDN support to make sure we're passing headers on "
"3xx and 4xx responses. This will allow us to expand the timeout on our CDN."
msgstr ""
"We've also expanded 该 CDN 支持 到 make sure we're passing 头部 于 3xx 和 4xx 响应. "
"这将允许我们扩展超时 于 我们的 CDN."

#: ../../upstream/CHANGELOG.rst:4679
msgid ""
"We've also updated and added a good amount of documentation in this release,"
" and we're starting a larger refactor of our docs to help users understand "
"the platform better."
msgstr ""
"We've also 已更新 和 已添加 一个 good amount 的 文档 在 此 发布, 和 we're 自 一个 larger 重构 的 "
"我们的 文档 到 help 用户 understand 该 platform better."

