#: ../../upstream/CHANGELOG.rst:4719
msgid ""
"As of this release, most documentation on Read the Docs Community is now "
"behind Cloudflare's CDN. It should be much faster for people further from US"
" East. Please report any issues you experience with stale cached "
"documentation (especially CSS/JS)."
msgstr ""
"为 的 此 发布, most 文档 于 Read 该 文档 Community 是 now behind Cloudflare's CDN. 它 "
"should be much faster 对 people further 从 US East. Please report any 问题 you "
"experience with stale cached 文档 (especially CSS/JS)."

#: ../../upstream/CHANGELOG.rst:4723
msgid ""
"Another change in this release related to how custom domains are handled. "
"Custom domains will now redirect HTTP -> HTTPS if the Domain's \"HTTPS\" "
"flag is set. Also, the subdomain URL (eg. ``<project>.readthedocs.io/...``) "
"should redirect to the custom domain if the Domain's \"canonical\" flag is "
"set. These flags are configurable in your project dashboard under "
":guilabel:`Admin` > :guilabel:`Domains`."
msgstr ""
"此版本中另一项更改与自定义域名的处理方式有关。自定义域名现在会将 HTTP 重定向到 HTTPS（如果该域名的 \"HTTPS\" "
"标志已设置）。此外，子域名 URL（例如 ``<project>.readthedocs.io/...``）应在该域名的 \"canonical\" "
"标志设置时重定向到自定义域名。这些标志可在项目仪表盘的 :guilabel:\\`Admin\\` > :guilabel:\\`Domains\\` "
"下配置。"

#: ../../upstream/CHANGELOG.rst:4729
msgid ""
"Many of the other changes related to improvements for our infrastructure to "
"allow us to have autoscaling build and web servers. There were bug fixes for"
" projects using versions tied to annotated git tags and custom user "
"redirects will now send query parameters."
msgstr ""
"Many 的 该 其他 更改 related 到 improvements 对 我们的 infrastructure 到 允许 us 到 have "
"autoscaling 构建 和 web servers. There were 缺陷 修复 对 项目 using 版本 tied 到 "
"annotated Git 标签 和 custom 用户 重定向 will now send 查询 参数."

