msgstr "已更新 Django 从 `1.6.11` 到 `1.8.3`."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/changelog.rst:25
msgid ""
"Removed South and ported the South migrations to Django's migration "
"framework."
msgstr "已移除 South 和 ported 该 South 迁移 到 Django's 迁移 framework."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/changelog.rst:26
msgid ""
"Updated django-celery from `3.0.23` to `3.1.26` as django-celery 3.0.x does "
"not support Django 1.8."
msgstr ""
"已更新 Django-celery 从 `3.0.23` 到 `3.1.26` 为 Django-celery 3.0.x does not 支持 "
"Django 1.8."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/changelog.rst:27
msgid ""
"Updated Celery from `3.0.24` to `3.1.18` because we had to update django-"
"celery. We need to test this extensively and might need to think about using"
" the new Celery API directly and dropping django-celery. See release notes: "
"https://docs.celeryproject.org/en/3.1/whatsnew-3.1.html"
msgstr ""
"已更新 Celery 从 `3.0.24` 到 `3.1.18` because we had 到 更新 Django-celery. We need "
"到 测试 此 extensively 和 might need 到 think about using 该 新 Celery API directly "
"和 dropping Django-celery. 参见 发行说明: "
"https://docs.celeryproject.org/en/3.1/whatsnew-3.1.html"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/changelog.rst:29
msgid ""
"Updated tastypie from `0.11.1` to current master (commit "
"`1e1aff3dd4dcd21669e9c68bd7681253b286b856`) as 0.11.x is not compatible with"
" Django 1.8. No surprises expected but we should ask for a proper release, "
"see release notes: https://github.com/django-tastypie/django-"
"tastypie/blob/master/docs/release_notes/v0.12.0.rst"
msgstr ""
"已更新 tastypie 从 `0.11.1` 到 current 主分支 (提交 "
"`1e1aff3dd4dcd21669e9c68bd7681253b286b856`) 为 0.11.x 是 not compatible with "
"Django 1.8. No surprises expected but we should ask 对 一个 proper 发布, 参见 发行说明:"
" https://github.com/django-tastypie/django-"
"tastypie/blob/master/docs/release_notes/v0.12.0.rst"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/changelog.rst:30
msgid ""
"Updated django-oauth from `0.16.1` to `0.21.0`. No surprises expected, see "
"release notes `in the docs <https://django-allauth.readthedocs.io/en/latest"
"/release-notes.html>`_ and `finer grained in the repo "
"<https://github.com/pennersr/django-"
"allauth/blob/9123223f167959e4e5c4074408db068f725559d1/ChangeLog#L1-169>`_"
msgstr ""
"已更新 Django-OAuth 从 `0.16.1` 到 `0.21.0`. No surprises expected, 参见 发行说明 `在 该 "
"docs <https://django-allauth.readthedocs.io/en/latest/release-notes.html>`_ "
"和 `finer grained 在 该 repo <https://github.com/pennersr/django-"
"allauth/blob/9123223f167959e4e5c4074408db068f725559d1/ChangeLog#L1-169>`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/changelog.rst:31
msgid ""
"Updated django-guardian from `1.2.0` to `1.3.0` to gain Django 1.8 support. "
"No surprises expected, see release notes: https://github.com/lukaszb/django-"
"guardian/blob/devel/CHANGES"
msgstr ""
"已更新 Django-guardian 从 `1.2.0` 到 `1.3.0` 到 gain Django 1.8 支持. No surprises "
"expected, 参见 发行说明: https://github.com/lukaszb/django-"
"guardian/blob/devel/CHANGES"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/changelog.rst:32
msgid ""
"Using `django-formtools` instead of removed `django.contrib.formtools` now. "
"Based on the Django release notes, these modules are the same except of the "
"package name."
