"Updated psycopg2 from 2.4 to 2.4.6 as 2.4.5 is required by Django 1.8. No "
"trouble expected as Django is the layer between us and psycopg2. Also it's "
"only a minor version upgrade. Release notes: "
"http://initd.org/psycopg/docs/news.html#what-s-new-in-psycopg-2-4-6"
msgstr ""
"已更新 psycopg2 从 2.4 到 2.4.6 为 2.4.5 是 required 由 Django 1.8. No trouble "
"expected 为 Django 是 该 layer between us 和 psycopg2. Also 它's only 一个 minor 版本"
" 升级. 发行说明: http://initd.org/psycopg/docs/news.html#what-s-new-in-"
"psycopg-2-4-6"

